			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Kashmer"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 735200203,
					"content": "\"That Incident From Twenty Years Ago\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735200204,
					"content": "... I guess I shouldn't have told anyone. Last time I had too much to drink and blabbered a little too much, and now people are seeking me out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200205,
					"content": "Since you're curious, I guess I'll tell you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200206,
					"content": "I was just six years old twenty years ago, so I can't remember clearly what happened at the time. But recently, I read the diary I kept when I was a child, and vaguely recalled the situation back then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200207,
					"content": "The Interdarshan Championship was also held that year. There were three rounds, the last of which was outside the city. I begged my mom to take me out of town to see it, and when she refused, I snuck out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200208,
					"content": "And then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200209,
					"content": "I ended up getting lost outside the city. In the middle of nowhere, there was no one around. I grew more and more frightened and began to cry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200210,
					"content": "That's when I saw some strange creatures... I can't remember what they looked like. I only remember how, as a child, I stopped crying at the sight of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200211,
					"content": "Strange creatures... they must be...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200212,
					"content": "(The Aranara.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735200213,
					"content": "They took me to the competition. Unfortunately, by the time we got there, it was too late. It was already over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200214,
					"content": "Just when I was disheartened, I suddenly saw one of those strange creatures slowly dragging a crown along.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200215,
					"content": "It was a beautiful crown, shining in the moonlight, and I could not help but follow it. I saw the little fellow hide the crown in a hollow tree before disappearing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200216,
					"content": "I wanted to touch that crown. But at the moment, I could hear the distant cries of my mother. It turns out, she figured out I was lost, and got her neighbors to go looking for me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200217,
					"content": "I never got to touch it. It wasn't until I was older, when I saw the \"Diadem of Knowledge\" at the Interdarshan Championship that I realized it was the same thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200218,
					"content": "Alright... do you remember where that diadem ended up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200219,
					"content": "It's probably in the Avidya Forest, but I've been back a few times, and I haven't found anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200220,
					"content": "No one would believe me, even if I told them. Alas, even I can't remember it clearly. Perhaps, it was a dream I had when I was a child.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735200221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kashmer"
				},
				{
					"id": 735200221,
					"content": "#Well... should we go look for it, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
